{"id":16,"role":"Tool","content":"C:\\github\\YangMills\\src\\lean\\YangMills\\Proofs\\PositiveDefiniteIntegral.lean\n-- 1165 lines, 59221 bytes --\n1000 | \n1001 | /-- **Character-expansion positivity (abstract lemma).**  If a kernel\n1002 | `K : X → Y → ℂ` has a finite separable decomposition\n1003 | `K(x, y) = ∑_i a_i · Φ_i(x) · conj(Φ_i(θ y))` with `a_i ≥ 0` and `θ`\n1004 | measure-preserving (`θ_*ν = μ`), then for real-valued `f`:\n1005 | `∫∫ f(x) · f(θ y) · K(x, y) dν(y) dμ(x) = ∑_i a_i · ‖∫ f · Φ_i dμ‖²`.\n1006 | \n1007 | No group structure, no character orthogonality — only the measure-preserving\n1008 | change of variables and the fact that `f` is real-valued. -/\n1009 | lemma character_expansion_positivity\n1010 |     {X Y : Type*} [MeasurableSpace X] [MeasurableSpace Y]\n1011 |     (μ : Measure X) (ν : Measure Y) [SigmaFinite μ] [SigmaFinite ν]\n1012 |     (θ : Y → X) (hθ : MeasurePreserving θ ν μ)\n1013 |     (ι : Type*) [Fintype ι] [DecidableEq ι]\n1014 |     (a : ι → ℝ)\n1015 |     (Φ : ι → X → ℂ) (f : X → ℝ)\n1016 |     (hΦ_meas : ∀ i, AEStronglyMeasurable (Φ i) μ)\n1017 |     (hf_meas : AEStronglyMeasurable (fun x => (f x : ℂ)) μ)\n1018 |     (hfΦ_int : ∀ i, Integrable (fun x => (f x : ℂ) * Φ i x) μ)\n1019 |     (K : X → Y → ℂ)\n1020 |     (hK : ∀ x y, K x y = ∑ i, (a i : ℂ) * (Φ i x * conj (Φ i (θ y)))) :\n1021 |     ∫ x, ∫ y, (f x : ℂ) * (f (θ y) : ℂ) * K x y ∂ν ∂μ =\n1022 |       ↑(∑ i, a i * ‖∫ x, (f x : ℂ) * Φ i x ∂μ‖^2) := by\n1023 |   -- Helper: AEStronglyMeasurable of conj(Φ i)\n1024 |   have hΦ_conj_meas : ∀ i, AEStronglyMeasurable (fun x => conj (Φ i x)) μ :=\n1025 |     fun i => Complex.continuous_conj.comp_aestronglyMeasurable (hΦ_meas i)\n1026 |   -- Helper: AEStronglyMeasurable of (f * conj(Φ i))\n1027 |   have hfΦ_conj_meas : ∀ i, AEStronglyMeasurable (fun x => (f x : ℂ) * conj (Φ i x)) μ :=\n1028 |     fun i => hf_meas.mul (hΦ_conj_meas i)\n1029 |   -- Helper: Integrable of (f * conj(Φ i)) — derived from hfΦ_int via norm equality\n1030 |   have hfΦ_conj_int : ∀ i, Integrable (fun x => (f x : ℂ) * conj (Φ i x)) μ := by\n1031 |     intro i\n1032 |     refine ⟨hfΦ_conj_meas i, ?_⟩\n1033 |     have hnorm : ∀ x, ‖(f x : ℂ) * conj (Φ i x)‖ = ‖(f x : ℂ) * Φ i x‖ := fun x => by\n1034 |       rw [norm_mul, norm_mul, Complex.norm_conj]\n1035 |     have hfi := (hfΦ_int i).2\n1036 |     rw [hasFiniteIntegral_iff_norm] at hfi ⊢\n1037 |     rw [lintegral_congr_ae (ae_of_all μ (fun x => by rw [hnorm]))]\n1038 |     exact hfi\n1039 |   -- Helper: Integrable of (f(θy) * conj(Φ i (θy))) w.r.t. ν\n1040 |   have hfΦ_conj_θ_int : ∀ i, Integrable (fun y => (f (θ y) : ℂ) * conj (Φ i (θ y))) ν :=\n1041 |     fun i => hθ.integrable_comp (hfΦ_conj_meas i) |>.mpr (hfΦ_conj_int i)\n1042 |   -- Helper: change of variables ∫_ν f(θy)·conj(Φ_i(θy)) dy = ∫_μ f(x)·conj(Φ_i(x)) dx\n1043 |   have hchange_var : ∀ i,\n1044 |       ∫ y, (f (θ y) : ℂ) * conj (Φ i (θ y)) ∂ν = ∫ x, (f x : ℂ) * conj (Φ i x) ∂μ := by\n1045 |     intro i\n1046 |     have hfm := hfΦ_conj_meas i\n1047 |     rw [← hθ.map_eq] at hfm ⊢\n1048 |     exact (integral_map hθ.measurable.aemeasurable hfm).symm\n1049 |   -- Helper: ∫_μ f·conj(Φ_i) = conj(∫_μ f·Φ_i)  (since f is real-valued)\n1050 |   have hconj_int : ∀ i,\n1051 |       ∫ x, (f x : ℂ) * conj (Φ i x) ∂μ = conj (∫ x, (f x : ℂ) * Φ i x ∂μ) := by\n1052 |     intro i\n1053 |     have heq : ∀ x, (f x : ℂ) * conj (Φ i x) = conj ((f x : ℂ) * Φ i x) := by\n1054 |       intro x\n1055 |       symm\n1056 |       rw [map_mul (starRingEnd ℂ), Complex.conj_ofReal]\n1057 |     rw [show (∫ x, (f x : ℂ) * conj (Φ i x) ∂μ) =\n1058 |         ∫ x, conj ((f x : ℂ) * Φ i x) ∂μ from by congr 1 with x; exact heq x]\n1059 |     exact Complex.conjCLE.integral_comp_comm _\n1060 |   -- Main computation\n1061 |   -- Substitute hK into the integrand\n1062 |   have hK_subst : ∀ x y,\n1063 |       (f x : ℂ) * (f (θ y) : ℂ) * K x y =\n1064 |         ∑ i, (a i : ℂ) * ((f x : ℂ) * Φ i x) * ((f (θ y) : ℂ) * conj (Φ i (θ y))) := by\n1065 | 