ransferMatrixPositivity_axiom`, which is\n1544 |       -- justified by `plaquetteBoltzmannPD` (Peter-Weyl / Clebsch-Gordan) ⟹\n1545 |       -- transfer matrix T positive ⟹ ∫ G·G(θU) ≥ 0.  See the axiom's docstring.\n1546 |       exact transferMatrixPositivity_axiom N T L β hT f hf_supported\n1547 | \n1548 | /-! ## Clean factorization and the PD-structure obstruction\n1549 | \n1550 | The reflection-positivity integrand `osG(U) · osG(θU)` factorizes cleanly as\n1551 | `f(U) · f(θU) · exp(-β S_W(U))` (lemma `osG_thetaG_factorization` below).\n1552 | This shows that the axiom `transferMatrixPositivity_axiom` is equivalent to:\n1553 | \n1554 |     ∫ f(U) · f(θU) · exp(-β S_W(U)) dμ₀ ≥ 0\n1555 | \n1556 | where `exp(-β S_W)` is the full Boltzmann factor, proved positive-definite on the\n1557 | full link-variable group by `boltzmannFactorPD` (in `BoltzmannFactor.lean`).\n1558 | \n1559 | **Key obstruction**: this integral is NOT the standard positive-definite quadratic\n\n... 105 more line(s) below (use offset=1560 to continue reading)","timestamp":1785487756,"token_count":2775,"tool_call_id":"04a65b53-41f7-4e8c-8765-bdd5c9103f41","full_token_estimate":1821,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"read_file","file_path":"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/ReflectionPositivity.lean","old_text":null,"new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":1664,"byte_count":102364,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":0,"edit_line":null},"turn":9,"is_prune_marker":false}
